#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Framerate:"
msgstr "影格率："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Number of bars:"
msgstr "頻譜柱數量："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Automatically calculated for the current visualizer style."
msgstr "根據當前視覺化樣式自動計算。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Automatic sensitivity:"
msgstr "自動靈敏度："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid ""
"will attempt to decrease sensitivity if the bars peak and increase slowly as "
"ong as the bars don't peak. 0 = off, 1 = normal, 2..n = more "
"aggressive<br>Increase to make sensitivity increase even faster."
msgstr ""
"當頻譜柱達到峰值時嘗試降低靈敏度，未達峰值時緩慢提升。0 = 關閉，1 = 正常，"
"2..n = 更激進<br>增大該值可使靈敏度提升更快。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Sensitivity:"
msgstr "靈敏度："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid ""
"Manual sensitivity in %.\n"
"If autosens is enabled, this will only be the initial value"
msgstr ""
"手動靈敏度（百分比）。\n"
"若啟用自動靈敏度，此值僅作為初始值。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Frequency range (Hz):"
msgstr "頻率範圍（Hz）："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Min"
msgstr "最小"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Max"
msgstr "最大"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid ""
"Lower and higher cutoff frequencies for lowest and highest bars, the "
"bandwidth of the visualizer.\n"
"Note: Cava will automatically increase the higher cutoff if a too low band "
"is specified."
msgstr ""
"最低和最高頻譜柱對應的截止頻率，即視覺化器的頻寬。\n"
"注意：若指定的頻帶過窄，CAVA會自動提高高頻截止值。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Sleep timer (seconds):"
msgstr "休眠計時器（秒）："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid ""
"Seconds with no input before cava goes to sleep mode.\n"
"Cava will not perform FFT and only check for input once per second."
msgstr ""
"無音訊輸入多少秒後進入休眠模式。\n"
"休眠期間CAVA不執行FFT，僅每秒檢查一次輸入。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Pause on:"
msgstr "何時暫停："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Full screen window"
msgstr "全螢幕視窗時"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Maximized window"
msgstr "最大化視窗時"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Input"
msgstr "輸入"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Method:"
msgstr "方法："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml ../contents/ui/configGeneral.qml
msgid "Default"
msgstr "預設"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid ""
"Audio capturing method.\n"
"Defaults to 'oss', 'pipewire', 'sndio', 'jack', 'pulse', 'alsa', 'portaudio' "
"or 'fifo', in that order, dependent on what support cava was built with.\n"
msgstr ""
"音訊捕獲方法。\n"
"預設按以下順序嘗試：\n"
"'oss'、'pipewire'、'sndio'、'jack'、'pulse'、'alsa'、'portaudio'或'fifo'，\n"
"具體取決於CAVA編譯時所包含的支援。\n"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Source:"
msgstr "源："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid ""
"For pulseaudio and pipewire 'source' will be the source. Default: 'auto', "
"which uses the monitor source of the default sink (all pulseaudio "
"sinks(outputs) have 'monitor' sources(inputs) associated with them)."
msgstr ""
"對於PulseAudio和PipeWire，'source'指音訊源。預設為'auto'，即使用預設輸出裝置"
"的監聽源（所有PulseAudio輸出裝置均有對應的監聽輸入源）。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid ""
"For pipewire 'source' will be the object name or object.serial of the device "
"to capture from. Both input and output devices are supported."
msgstr ""
"對於PipeWire，'source'可為裝置的物件名稱或object.serial，支援輸入和輸出裝置。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "For alsa 'source' will be the capture device."
msgstr "對於ALSA，'source'為錄音裝置。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "For fifo 'source' will be the path to fifo-file."
msgstr "對於FIFO，'source'為FIFO檔案路徑。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid ""
"For shmem 'source' will be /squeezelite-AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF where "
"'AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF' will be squeezelite's MAC address."
msgstr ""
"對於shmem，'source'為/squeezelite-AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF，其"
"中'AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF'為squeezelite的MAC地址。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid ""
"For sndio 'source' will be a raw recording audio descriptor or a monitoring "
"sub-device, e.g. 'rsnd/2' or 'snd/1'. Default: 'default'."
msgstr ""
"對於sndio，'source'為原始錄音音訊描述符或監聽子裝置（如'rsnd/2'或'snd/1'）。"
"預設值：'default'。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid ""
"For oss 'source' will be the path to a audio device, e.g. '/dev/dsp2'. "
"Default: '/dev/dsp', i.e. the default audio device."
msgstr ""
"對於OSS，'source'為音訊裝置路徑（如'/dev/dsp2'）。預設值：'/dev/dsp'（即預設"
"音訊裝置）。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid ""
"For jack 'source' will be the name of the JACK server to connect to, e.g. "
"'foobar'. Default: 'default'."
msgstr ""
"對於JACK，'source'為要連線的JACK伺服器名稱（如'foobar'）。預設值：'default'。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Sample rate:"
msgstr "取樣率："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Only for fifo, pipewire, sndio, oss"
msgstr "僅適用於fifo、pipewire、sndio、oss"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Sample bits:"
msgstr "取樣位元深度："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Channels:"
msgstr "聲道數："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Only for pipewire & cava>=0.10.6, sndio, oss, jack"
msgstr "僅適用於pipewire（CAVA ≥ 0.10.6）、sndio、oss、jack"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Auto connect:"
msgstr "自動連線："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Only for jack"
msgstr "僅適用於jack"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Active:"
msgstr "啟用："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid ""
"Only for pipewire & cava>=0.10.6. Force the node to always process. Useful "
"for monitoring sources when no other application is active."
msgstr ""
"僅適用於pipewire（CAVA ≥ 0.10.6）。強制節點始終處理音訊，適用於無其他應用活躍"
"時監聽音訊源。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Remix:"
msgstr "混音："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid ""
"Only for pipewire & cava>=0.10.6. Allow to remix audio channels to match "
"cava's channel count. Useful for surround sound."
msgstr ""
"僅適用於pipewire（CAVA ≥ 0.10.6）。允許重混音訊聲道以匹配CAVA的聲道數，適用於"
"環繞聲。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Virtual:"
msgstr "虛擬："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid ""
"Only for pipewire & cava>=0.10.6. Set the node to virtual, to avoid "
"recording notifications from the DE."
msgstr ""
"僅適用於pipewire（CAVA ≥ 0.10.6）。將節點設為虛擬，避免桌面環境彈出錄音通知。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Output"
msgstr "輸出"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Visual channels:"
msgstr "視覺化聲道："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid ""
"'mono' outputs left to right lowest to highest frequencies.\n"
"'stereo' mirrors both channels with low frequencies in center."
msgstr ""
"「單聲道(mono)」從左到右顯示從低到高的頻率。\n"
"「立體聲(stereo)」鏡像顯示雙聲道，低頻位於中央。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Mono channel:"
msgstr "單聲道選項："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Display frequencies the other way around"
msgstr "以相反順序顯示頻率"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Waveform:"
msgstr "波形："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid ""
"Show waveform instead of frequency spectrum. Takes precedence over the "
"simulate waveform option."
msgstr "顯示波形而非頻譜。優先於模擬波形選項。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Smoothing"
msgstr "平滑"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Noise reduction:"
msgstr "降噪："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid ""
"The raw visualization is very noisy, this factor adjusts the integral and "
"gravity filters to keep the signal smooth.\n"
"100 will be very slow and smooth, 0 will be fast but noisy."
msgstr ""
"原始視覺化雜訊較大，此參數透過積分與重力濾波器使訊號平滑。\n"
"100表示極慢且平滑，0表示快速但雜訊明顯。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Monstercat:"
msgstr "Monstercat平滑："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid ""
"Enable the so-called \"Monstercat smoothing\" with or without \"waves\"."
msgstr "啟用被稱為「Monstercat平滑」的效果，可選擇是否同時啟用「波浪效果」。"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Waves"
msgstr "波浪效果"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Equalizer"
msgstr "均衡器"

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid "Enabled:"
msgstr "啟用："

#: ../contents/ui/configCava.qml
msgid ""
"Adjust frequencies by a multiplication factor, more bands equals more "
"precision."
msgstr "透過乘法因子調整頻率，頻段越多，精度越高。"

#: ../contents/ui/configGeneral.qml
msgid "Auto-hide when idle:"
msgstr "閒置時自動隱藏："

#: ../contents/ui/configGeneral.qml
msgid "After"
msgstr "在"

#: ../contents/ui/configGeneral.qml
msgid "seconds"
msgstr "秒後"

#: ../contents/ui/configGeneral.qml
msgid "Hide when no media player:"
msgstr "無媒體播放器時隱藏："

#: ../contents/ui/configGeneral.qml
msgid ""
"Show the widget based on media player status (MPRIS) instead of audio "
"activity (other sounds won't show it). Stays visible while playback is "
"paused. Takes precedence over auto-hide when idle."
msgstr ""
"根據媒體播放器狀態(MPRIS)而非音訊活動決定是否顯示(其他聲音不會使其顯示)。播放"
"暫停期間保持可見。優先於「閒置時自動隱藏」。"

#: ../contents/ui/configGeneral.qml
msgid "Desktop background:"
msgstr "桌面背景："

#: ../contents/ui/configGeneral.qml
msgid "Transparent"
msgstr "透明"

#: ../contents/ui/configGeneral.qml
msgid "Transparent with shadow"
msgstr "透明帶陰影"

#: ../contents/ui/configGeneral.qml
msgid "Disable tooltip:"
msgstr "停用工具提示："

#: ../contents/ui/configGeneral.qml
msgid "Disable ToolTip that shows the widget name and description."
msgstr "停用顯示小工具名稱和描述的工具提示。"

#: ../contents/ui/configGeneral.qml
msgid "Disable left click:"
msgstr "停用左鍵點選："

#: ../contents/ui/configGeneral.qml
msgid "Applet popup will still be accessible from the right click menu."
msgstr "仍可透過右鍵選單開啟小工具彈出視窗。"

#: ../contents/ui/configGeneral.qml
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: ../contents/ui/configGeneral.qml
msgid "Debug mode:"
msgstr "除錯模式："

#: ../contents/ui/configGeneral.qml
msgid ""
"Print additional messages to the system log. To make it easier to spot "
"sizing issues, this will also force full height to the first visualizer bar "
"and displays a grid over it."
msgstr ""
"向系統日誌輸出額外資訊。\n"
"為便於發現尺寸問題，此選項還會強制將第一條頻譜柱設為最大高度，並在整個區域上"
"顯示網格。"

#: ../contents/ui/configVisualizer.qml
msgid "height"
msgstr "高度"

#: ../contents/ui/configVisualizer.qml
msgid "width"
msgstr "寬度"

